in":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형들이","audio":"/audio/4de71add65ec38090196.mp3"}},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}},{"text":"뺏고","meaning":"夺走，抢走","explanation":"뺏다：夺走，抢走；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뺏다","audio":"/audio/66578c75119a16c91d03.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15650","senseId":"1","lemma":"뺏다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뺏고","audio":"/audio/bff909a2186b4662c89c.mp3"}},{"text":"나를","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나를","audio":"/audio/4225b1c78642e45b4068.mp3"}},{"text":"때렸어.","meaning":"打，揍，抽","explanation":"때리다：打，揍，抽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"때리다","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14433","senseId":"1","lemma":"때리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때렸어","audio":"/audio/1cf92ba7f44562a87ba5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"经由，途经","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"经过某条路，向这边移动。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥哥（男性对年长男性的亲切称呼）","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"66578c75119a16c9","term":"뺏다","zh":"夺走，抢走","audio":"/audio/66578c75119a16c91d03.mp3","entryId":"15650","definition":"强制地将他人拥有的东西除去或占为己有。","pronunciation":["뺃ː따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"97474f90b9c0f4d7","term":"때리다","zh":"打，揍，抽","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3","entryId":"14433","definition":"用手或手中的东西狠狠地打击。","pronunciation":["때리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d1ce80edbb5c67540c65.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.565,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14433","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1171,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["回家时几个年纪大的男生抢了我的钱，还打了我。","你的脸怎么了？受伤了吗？","为什么会晕车啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的脸怎么了？受伤了吗？","为什么会晕车啊？","回家时几个年纪大的男生抢了我的钱，还打了我。"],"answer":2}]}
